{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_002_1000_p", "source_sha256": "4e443d5c4f79087ebf2e7c532d965e33883326a8978bf4163611f7bcee47a75d", "ja": "（今、さっき撮った昴の宣材写真を見ている。表情は\n明るいし、いいポーズもしてるとは思うんだけど……）", "zh": "（我正在看昴刚才拍的宣传照。\n她的表情很开朗，姿势也摆得很棒，但……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_002_1001_047sub", "source_sha256": "243cf3fb11fe4e2157680634e28450eecec6e1132046565c1a49588e54848439", "ja": "なあ、{$P$}。\n写真のオレ、なんか違う気がしない？", "zh": "欸，{$P$}。\n这照片里的我是不是怪怪的啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_002_1002_p", "source_sha256": "d5a4295ab241b165341be4801347ea8a7b03764c1268027c7bda221d2fc6e7a3", "ja": "昴もそう感じてたのか……。", "zh": "昴，你也这么觉得吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_002_1003_047sub", "source_sha256": "571ce86dac132c6bf03885d5dd6835824ae608328c5d911397656cfd68b93ef7", "ja": "うん。家族にアイドルのこととか聞いてさ、\n色々な表情やポーズは、勉強してきたんだ。", "zh": "嗯。其实我有跟家人问过偶像的事情，\n研究了很多表情和姿势。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_002_1004_047sub", "source_sha256": "b848f7c4a4d0d7738079ebed3a0eee7240a2f80cef54f8a4490efb0dde09ec66", "ja": "撮った写真見ると、ちゃんとそれっぽくなってる気は\nするんだけど……うーん、なんかなぁ。", "zh": "现在看到拍出来的照片，\n的确是有点偶像的样子……嗯──但就是怪怪的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_002_1005_p", "source_sha256": "47d0433e6f51e44bb9e47fc68a3fd4fa25966feea3304dba7e1ad69a19587e66", "ja": "俺もそう思うよ。初めてのはずなのに、\nすごくいい表情で撮れてる。", "zh": "我也这么觉得。你虽然是第一次拍宣传照，\n表情却拍得很棒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_002_1006_047sub", "source_sha256": "b5da0ca831a10b5be394f548c96b9571684c0442da2965d36e8c4c051417e4ac", "ja": "なのに、なんでこんなに\n「違う！」って思っちゃうんだろ……。", "zh": "可是，到底为什么会让人觉得\n这么不对劲呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_002_1007_p", "source_sha256": "75bf6fed1f46c8cabb8d824cda8eef05d24c34138bb9f744035fef3565860618", "ja": "（いいポーズをしているのに、何か違う理由か……）", "zh": "（她的姿势都很好看，应该不是这个原因……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_002_1008", "source_sha256": "dd64f4a5b653f7f2d0a46a7face8239f04bafad1cb2dabfd4404ed16d78ec5a4", "ja": "はっ！", "zh": "啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_002_2000_p", "source_sha256": "f29c14489f6f7f123c43409b46a695cd5d2934eabe2a960d8073e0bf629b58bb", "ja": "……そうだ。理由がわかったぞ、昴！", "zh": "……我懂了。我知道为什么啦，昴！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_002_2001_047sub", "source_sha256": "0b46939577c635a59f8fb5ada626f08e1b8b3762b924300e021d5ced3707becd", "ja": "本当か！？\n{$P$}、オレにも教えてよ！", "zh": "真的吗！？\n{$P$}，快告诉我啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_002_2002_p", "source_sha256": "728b2ba10e30b17f3cc66c2d39c8f95c901be23dfee3b7d3797b8b370641e7f2", "ja": "たぶんだけど、アイドルっぽくなっている代わりに、\n昴らしさが薄れちゃってるんじゃないかな。", "zh": "我在猜，会不会是因为昴变得有偶像样子的同时，\n却也牺牲了自己的特色呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_002_2003_047sub", "source_sha256": "62e2484e3e43f796a96b0f28e4efb9ea33fb73ba69ba5680419ddb51d84e3422", "ja": "オレらしさ……？", "zh": "我的特色……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_002_2004_p", "source_sha256": "e90bdb7e0efc165a30e8f876369f62aaf53021ba61f4dc9560ef1246bb80afe7", "ja": "うん。昴の良さは、他の誰でもなく、\n昴にしかないものだからな。", "zh": "嗯。因为昴的特质是独一无二的，\n其他人身上可找不到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_002_2005_047sub", "source_sha256": "0f682f6310c23d88e57d9395b41e8203cac0f2117aefdfbc438b77158d073557", "ja": "そうか……。アイドルだからって、\n無理矢理、女の子っぽくしたから変なのかも。", "zh": "这样啊……因为我想说偶像就要有女生的样子，\n而勉强自己装模作样，所以才怪怪的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_002_2006_047sub", "source_sha256": "806042e2b6e297c53f106b3e6ed1bfc0b84bd2dcf5767952beeeaa062abf9803", "ja": "……よし！　{$P$}！\n今度はオレらしく、元気な感じで撮っていいかな？", "zh": "……好！{$P$}！\n接下来我可以顺其自然，用活泼的样子去拍吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_002_2007_p", "source_sha256": "19328793414dad2465c12540d39d27faf9b9bbbcf4342a8530afe3378f688034", "ja": "ああ、やってみよう！", "zh": "当然可以，试试看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_002_2008_047sub", "source_sha256": "71812d6c2f86e04106ee41cc386df0f357f9aad53fbf2473f015fc98881415f6", "ja": "どう！？　今度はオレらしくなったよな♪", "zh": "怎么样！？这次有拍出我的特色了吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_002_2009_p", "source_sha256": "c506deeea8541383787e2f706ac6ddc09d91d1f17abf0c8cdffd35209c5f53c6", "ja": "ああ！　イキイキとしてて、すごく昴らしいよ！", "zh": "有啊！活力充沛的样子，很有昴的特色！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_002_2010_047sub", "source_sha256": "2ee8df29b33a7ef719d7d36c03aa69d21fefdd180283aec77621cd2de58de32c", "ja": "へへー、簡単なことだったんだな。\n他のアイドルのマネしちゃダメだったんだ。", "zh": "嘿嘿──原来答案这么简单。\n我不该模仿其他偶像的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_002_2011_047sub", "source_sha256": "db322e4cd534a743aca0095aed7a4f9b3d94b7e6b5429b900a944638cb4937f3", "ja": "オレはオレらしく、\n元気なアイドルを目指すことにするぜ！", "zh": "我要忠于自我，\n目标是成为充满活力的偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_002_2012_p", "source_sha256": "1db1fd5270a11581391c6897b6527293b99ce0409edbd1951a364688f723ed57", "ja": "まあ、方向性については今度、話すとして……さて。\n最初に撮った写真はもったいないけど、処分して……。", "zh": "这个嘛，以后再来讨论要走什么路线吧……好啦，\n虽然有点可惜，但一开始拍的照片还是得处理掉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_002_2013_047sub", "source_sha256": "26b6e09eeca26eebb4296fecdeb0fa077614e9ee5cbfdbe2e00db83b468c1f2f", "ja": "あ……。え、えっと、{$P$}。\nその、捨てるなら、最初の写真、1枚もらってもいい？", "zh": "啊……不、不好意思，{$P$}。\n那个，既然要丢掉，可以给我一张一开始拍的照片吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_002_2014_047sub", "source_sha256": "f9c4727c1bc20e20e6429f3abd6102ebda96fdc92ea022a79908cc7b05470df4", "ja": "元気な方がオレには合ってると思うけど、\nカワイイのも、ちょっとは研究しておきたいから……。", "zh": "虽然活泼的样子比较适合我，\n但我还是想研究一下可爱风格……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_002_2015_p", "source_sha256": "ed9bad6f1f0b473a907d8ceb333ed7547cd0eb6ae293d922db308536f5e35081", "ja": "（今でも充分可愛いと思うけど……。まあ、\nそれも踏まえて昴の魅力か。今後が楽しみだ！）", "zh": "（但我觉得现在的昴就够可爱了……不过，\n这也是昴的魅力之一吧。她的将来真令人期待！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
